import os
p='images/rootfs.img'
fd=os.open(p, os.O_RDONLY)
size=os.fstat(fd).st_size
off=0
print('apparent size:', size)
extents=[]
while off < size:
    try:
        d=os.lseek(fd, off, os.SEEK_DATA)
    except OSError:
        break
    try:
        h=os.lseek(fd, d, os.SEEK_HOLE)
    except OSError:
        h=size
    extents.append((d,h))
    off=h
for d,h in extents:
    print(f'DATA  start={d:>10} ({d/1024:.1f} KiB)  end={h:>10}  len={h-d}')
print('num data extents:', len(extents))
if extents:
    print('last data byte offset (exclusive):', extents[-1][1])
os.close(fd)
""}
